• Carry out field review of civil construction works;

• Carry out laboratory testing on soils, rock, concrete, and asphalt materials;

• Assist with geotechnical investigations – including the sampling of soil and rock from boreholes and test pits; and

• Interface with clients on laboratory and field test results.

