Service New Brunswick is seeking individuals to join the Laundry and Linen Services branch within the Health Services Division as a Laundry Services Worker at the Edmundston Regional Hospital..

Reporting to the Manager, the successful candidate will be responsible for the following duties and responsibilities, but not limited to:

