• Receives laundry requisitions;

• Loads, scans, weighs, marks, records, and wraps clean laundry carts for delivery;

• Distributes clean laundry carts; loads and unloads laundry trucks as required;

• Shows others how to perform tasks or duties as part of the departmental orientation; as well as,

• Maintains a clean and safe work area.

## ESSENTIAL QUALIFICATIONS:

• Possess a high school diploma or have successfully completed a G.E.D.

• Written and spoken competence in French is required.

An equivalent combination of education, training and experience may be considered.

