CBCL is seeking an Intermediate to Senior Piping Designer to join our Industrial Mechanical Engineering team based in Fredericton, NB!

Join us and help shape both our work environment and company culture by collaborating with other design and construction professionals on challenging and exciting industrial projects. From concept to completion, bring your passion for sustainable design principles to life while delivering exceptional results for our clients.

We are looking for an experienced piping designer who can bring strong technical ability, sound judgment, and a collaborative approach to industrial projects. The ideal candidate will have hands-on experience from industrial environments (project engineering, maintenance, operations, or technical roles) or from consulting teams designing industrial mechanical systems, and be comfortable translating mark-ups and field information into clear, accurate CAD and modelling deliverables using tools such as AutoCAD Plant 3D. Experience with process fluid systems, petrochemical storage and transfer, storage tanks, compressed gas systems, boilers, power plants, or other industrial systems would be considered an asset.

