• A diploma in Mechanical Engineering Technology, Mechanical Engineering Design, or equivalent training/experience that demonstrates the ability to produce industrial mechanical and piping CAD deliverables;

• Proficiency with AutoCAD and Plant 3D is required. Experience with other 3D mechanical/plant design tools (e.g., Inventor, SolidWorks, Revit, or similar) would be considered an asset;

