• Master's degree in a health-related field considered an asset;

• Certification in health care administration/management considered an asset;

• Certification in process optimization or project management considered an asset;

• Certificate in process and quality improvement considered an asset;

• Minimum of five (5) years of experience in the health care sector, in roles requiring collaboration and engagement of health care professionals, group facilitation, workforce planning, or a related field;

• Minimum of two (2) years of experience in project management, change management, and continuous quality improvement;

• An equivalent combination of education and experience may be considered;

