NLHS - Labrador Grenfell Zone requires a dynamic Manager of Patient Services to provide creative leadership, support, and direction at the Labrador West Health Centre. The ideal candidate is a proven leader with excellent leadership, communication, planning and organizational skills, a critical thinker with experience in quality improvement and risk management initiatives to promote optimal delivery of client care. The Manager of Patient Services is responsible for providing day-to-day leadership and direction to the staff of Inpatients and Long-Term Care. The candidate must possess computer skills including Microsoft word, power point, and excel databases and spreadsheets. Other duties include financial accountability, policy and standard development, and Human Resource management. This position reports to the Director of Acute Care and the Director of Long-Term Care and Personal Care Homes.

