Duties (included but not limited to)

• In collaboration with team members plans, organizes, manages, and evaluates the clinical programs and services for Inpatients and Long-Term Care;

• Provides leadership and guidance to members of the care team;

• Implements and follows evidence-based practices to guide clinical care;

• Supports the development of policies and procedures;

• Assists in formulating the annual budget for service area;

• Responsible for controlling supplies and maintaining budgets including overtime relief;

• Assists the respective Director with determining long and short-term staffing needs, makes recommendations for transfers, disciplinary actions, and promotions;

• Collaborates with the respective Director and staff in setting goals and objectives for the clinical units;

• Monitors staff needs, actively recruits, and interviews staff;

