• Experience in marine structural design, construction inspection, contract administration, project coordination, and project management;

• Solid understanding of marine construction methods and the interpretation of engineering drawings, specifications, and contract documents;

• Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with the ability to prepare clear technical documentation and client-facing reports;

