• Recognizes cultural diversity;

• Provides on the job advice, guidance, feedback, orientation to new employees, and on the job training to staff and students;

• Performs a team lead role at the scene of medical emergencies and is responsible to take a lead role in managing the activities of the medical management team;

• Travel is required;

• May be required to work alone;

• Other related duties as required

Our team is seeking an Advanced Care Paramedic for a full-time position. If no Advanced Care Paramedic applicants, we will consider applications from Primary Care Paramedics and Ambulance Operators/Attendants. We prioritize candidates based on their qualifications in the following order: Advanced Care Paramedic, Primary Care Paramedic, or Ambulance Operator/Attendant.

