CBCL is seeking a Buildings Mechanical Engineer to join our Buildings Engineering team in Halifax, NS!

Help us shape our work environment and our culture by working collaboratively with other design and construction professionals on challenging and exciting building projects, as part of our thriving company. Through all stages of the building design process, let your passion for sustainable design principles shine through by delivering exceptional results for our clients.

As our ideal candidate, you have experience with designing building mechanical systems, in the areas of HVAC, plumbing, fire protection, building systems controls and commissioning, as well as energy efficiency and renewable energy design and assessment. You are a motivated self-starter, who is excited to participate with an established team of professional engineers and technologists in developing innovative multidisciplinary building design solutions, with an emphasis on client satisfaction and design practices.

Your Key Responsibilities:

• Assist a design team to prepare contract documents for the following systems: HVAC, plumbing, fire protection and building systems controls;

